  "description": {
    "en": "Wilson Spin Effect Hybrid combines Revolve 17 / 1.25 mm polyester with Sensation 16 / 1.30 mm multifilament to create a spin-focused hybrid built around string movement and snapback. Revolve provides the polyester component needed for spin, control and dynamic string return, while Sensation contributes comfort, power and shock absorption. The combination is designed to increase string movement and ball rotation while offering more playability and comfort than a full polyester stringbed.",

    "zh": "Wilson Spin Effect Hybrid 是一套围绕 Spin、String Movement 与 Snapback 设计的官方混合线，由 Revolve 17 / 1.25 毫米聚酯线与 Sensation 16 / 1.30 毫米多芯线组成。Revolve 负责提供聚酯所需的旋转、控制和动态回位能力，而 Sensation 则补充舒适性、力量与减震表现。两者结合能够让球线在击球过程中产生更明显的移动和 Snapback，从而增加 Ball Rotation，同时又比整床聚酯拥有更好的舒适性和 Playability。"
  },

